{"3275970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Guidance by Black and White", "steam_appid": 3275970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275970/extras/63ebf911d10fbaec68743e451fbaf280.avif?t=1784032336\" alt=\"\"width=360 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275970/extras/1fa8de1b6d7a611b646227640062ef7a.webp?t=1784032336\" width=32 height=32 /></span>This game is not a &quot;female protagonist&quot; because you will play with different characters presenting in the game, which are animals and they will help you on your path. The story is meant to understand of needing each other's help, fighting and solving together the problems ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275970/extras/1fa8de1b6d7a611b646227640062ef7a.webp?t=1784032336\" width=32 height=32 /></span>The gameplay includes also fighting against evil with different &quot;Magical Creatures&quot; alongside you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275970/extras/1fa8de1b6d7a611b646227640062ef7a.webp?t=1784032336\" width=32 height=32 /></span>Receiving &quot;magical&quot; gifts while progressing the story to improve fighting to attack a single or multiple enemies at once. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275970/extras/48d1d58d86233060e4e5ad09ebce3598.avif?t=1784032336\" alt=\"\"width=360 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275970/extras/1fa8de1b6d7a611b646227640062ef7a.webp?t=1784032336\" width=32 height=32 /></span>​You may visit many different nature locations in the game with different things to do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275970/extras/33e5e36401da4b44fe82808c54690ab9.webp?t=1784032336\" width=32 height=32 /></span>​The four seasons of nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275970/extras/33e5e36401da4b44fe82808c54690ab9.webp?t=1784032336\" width=32 height=32 /></span>​Space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275970/extras/33e5e36401da4b44fe82808c54690ab9.webp?t=1784032336\" width=32 height=32 /></span>Jungle (with boat).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275970/extras/33e5e36401da4b44fe82808c54690ab9.webp?t=1784032336\" width=32 height=32 /></span>Underwater.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275970/extras/33e5e36401da4b44fe82808c54690ab9.webp?t=1784032336\" width=32 height=32 /></span>With water areas. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275970/extras/33e5e36401da4b44fe82808c54690ab9.webp?t=1784032336\" width=32 height=32 /></span>Destructive areas (with lava). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275970/extras/1fa8de1b6d7a611b646227640062ef7a.webp?t=1784032336\" width=32 height=32 /></span>Hear the richest forests to destructive or watery atmospheres sounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Headphone highly recommended for the best gaming experience). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275970/extras/1fa8de1b6d7a611b646227640062ef7a.webp?t=1784032336\" width=32 height=32 /></span>​This is NOT an open world but a linear storytelling video game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275970/extras/1fa8de1b6d7a611b646227640062ef7a.webp?t=1784032336\" width=32 height=32 /></span>​Lots of different animals to be found in different nature locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275970/extras/1fa8de1b6d7a611b646227640062ef7a.webp?t=1784032336\" width=32 height=32 /></span>Different animals to meet that will help your character to fight, search and guide you throughout the gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275970/extras/1fa8de1b6d7a611b646227640062ef7a.webp?t=1784032336\" width=32 height=32 /></span>​Discover &quot;Magical Creatures&quot; with different power elements like: Earth, Water, Fire, Air and Space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275970/extras/1fa8de1b6d7a611b646227640062ef7a.webp?t=1784032336\" width=32 height=32 /></span>There is NO choice option for &quot;Easy, Normal and Hard&quot; difficulties in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275970/extras/1fa8de1b6d7a611b646227640062ef7a.webp?t=1784032336\" width=32 height=32 /></span>Highly recommended to play with a controller (only USB, not wireless) for a smooth gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275970/extras/33e5e36401da4b44fe82808c54690ab9.webp?t=1784032336\" width=32 height=32 /></span>Xbox controller (for Xbox Series X|S and Xbox One).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275970/extras/33e5e36401da4b44fe82808c54690ab9.webp?t=1784032336\" width=32 height=32 /></span>​PlayStation 4 controller (Dualshock 4 V2).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275970/extras/33e5e36401da4b44fe82808c54690ab9.webp?t=1784032336\" width=32 height=32 /></span>PlayStation 5 controller (DualSense).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275970/extras/26565ded3560eea9a6fdf659dfba0237.avif?t=1784032336\" alt=\"\"width=360 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>TECHNICAL ISSUES</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When playing the demo on Steam, I would like to recommend to share your issues during gameplay (bugs, errors, etc.) into our community page on Steam, please.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to describe as best as possible: What  is the issue? Where did it happen? Who? (which player you are currently playing or which object). When would it happen? That would be helpful for us to find the issue within the game. <br>Thank you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275970/extras/63ebf911d10fbaec68743e451fbaf280.avif?t=1784032336\" alt=\"\"width=360 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275970/extras/1fa8de1b6d7a611b646227640062ef7a.webp?t=1784032336\" width=32 height=32 /></span>This game is not a &quot;female protagonist&quot; because you will play with different characters presenting in the game, which are animals and they will help you on your path. The story is meant to understand of needing each other's help, fighting and solving together the problems ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275970/extras/1fa8de1b6d7a611b646227640062ef7a.webp?t=1784032336\" width=32 height=32 /></span>The gameplay includes also fighting against evil with different &quot;Magical Creatures&quot; alongside you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275970/extras/1fa8de1b6d7a611b646227640062ef7a.webp?t=1784032336\" width=32 height=32 /></span>Receiving &q